---
description: Next.js user-web rules for apps/user-web/
globs: apps/user-web/**
---

Full rules in `docs/rules/user-web.md`. Key points:

- Same CA as admin-web; middleware checks `role === 'user'`
- Protected route group: `(app)` instead of `(dashboard)`
- Cookie name: `owezy_access_token`
- Design tokens from `packages/design-system/` only
- Always read `resources/web-user/` before writing UI
